          <li style="margin-bottom: 12px;"><strong>Structural Amnesia</strong> is the deliberate, mechanical formatting of the soul's memory. It is a necessary security protocol executed by the Archons to ensure the incarnated spark accepts the physical simulation as base reality.</li>
          <li style="margin-bottom: 12px;">In esoteric mythology, this process is allegorized as drinking from the <strong>Waters of Lethe</strong> (the river of forgetfulness) or receiving the "Draught of Forgetfulness" before entering the physical body.</li>
